<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><variables><variable id="h;LY-oA-eeQGx=X3Cz]p">energy</variable><variable id="]AF6sfj;NvlsEZJd^OSH">happiness</variable></variables><block type="pxt-on-start" id="d5dIBSb%[`[9SQT{+|oL" x="0" y="0"><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">On start, I have set the stats to 50. The reason I did that is because the stat decay wouldn't take too long to kill the pet, punishing people who aren't doing anything to their pets in a quick way. + 50 is a smaller number, it is easier to view when your looking at the stats on the microbit (A+B).</comment><data>{"commentRefs":[],"fieldData":{"~commentOffsetX":"16","~commentOffsetY":"16"}}</data><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="device_pause" id="M$-_PSd}z]FyKK#_xaUP"><value name="pause"><shadow type="timePicker" id="so0PFZ`@;nNH@T+Kzm+("><field name="ms">100</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id=",@wa;X+u@pVd{dZeG8B;"><field name="VAR" id="h;LY-oA-eeQGx=X3Cz]p">energy</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id=")}0HqE^R:A71HC}AwHh|"><field name="NUM">50</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="[im,I{{?UVG:%s/+c8-x"><field name="VAR" id="]AF6sfj;NvlsEZJd^OSH">happiness</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="TOQXfaw=NoP^lt#wC7T)"><field name="NUM">50</field></shadow></value><next><block type="function_call" id="MMh2zN$Eqj)OKBxx1%DO"><mutation name="_default" functionid="sC19rv_SnG#)z0:+/XX`"></mutation></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block><block type="device_forever" id="_Hfbun)ZbF7e/;4*TN]g" x="1215" y="-61"><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Randomly does a pooping animation from 0-10 minutes, decreases happiness.</comment><data>{"commentRefs":[],"fieldData":{"~commentOffsetX":"16","~commentOffsetY":"16"}}</data><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="device_pause" id="]|pa0BUU$2_KEz/nuG9f"><value name="pause"><shadow type="timePicker" id="~uT!8IrA5D6~:v?d~V6y